The sender domain has a softfail SPF policy:

$ dig +short txt softfail.mail.mgm-sp.team
"v=spf1 a:ile-d-if.mgm-sp.team ~all"

The ~all mechanism causes a softfail for any IP not matching ile-d-if.mgm-sp.team.
Most servers accept the mail but mark it as suspicious.
